====== TP-Link TL-WR740N ======
The TP-Link WR740N is an even lower-cost (around 20€/$20 retail in 10/2012) variant of the [[tl-wr741nd|TP-Link WR741ND]] differing only in the non-removable antenna.

Since the hardware in WR740N is similar to WR741N, most of the contents in [[tl-wr741nd|TP-Link WR741ND]] applies to this router too.

